Package: 8dock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: desktop dock launcher for V\OS
 8Dock is a small desktop dock: drag files and applications onto it and
 double-click to launch them, right-click to switch between big and
 small icons, and drop items on the Trash slot. Items show their Tracker
 icons and watch their targets through the node monitor.
